Subject: [PATCH 12/17] qt: command palette (Ctrl+K) and keyboard shortcut
 overlay

FuzzyMatch ranks entries (best alignment, word starts and consecutive letters score high; tested
with mutation checks). HotkeyActions lists every hotkey action from VLC's key configuration with the
live binding and runs one through the same key-action variable a key press ends in. ActionOverlay
shows dialogs and hotkeys in a palette, or only the bound ones as a shortcut overlay.
